(   - K: Soil Erodibility Factor. Reflects the intrinsic susceptibility of a specific soil type to) Tj
T*
(   detachment and transport, governed by particle size distribution, organic matter content, soil) Tj
T*
(   structure, and permeability.) Tj
T*
(   - LS: Topographic Factor \(Length-Slope\). Represents the ratio of soil loss from a specific) Tj
T*
