T*
(   9% slope\).) Tj
T*
(   - C: Cover and Management Factor. Compares soil loss from a specified cropping system against) Tj
T*
(   clean-tilled continuous fallow land \(varies from ~0.001 for dense forest to 1.0 for bare plowed) Tj
T*
(   soil\).) Tj
T*
(   - P: Support Practice Factor. Accounts for the soil-conserving effect of specific mechanical) Tj
T*
(   practices like contour plowing \(P ~ 0.5-0.6\), strip cropping \(P ~ 0.25-0.3\), or bench terracing) Tj
T*
