(   [Problem Statement]: Analyze the mechanisms of soil compaction, loss of soil pore architecture, and the hydrological impacts of urban soil sealing.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Mechanisms of Soil Compaction and Urban Soil Sealing:) Tj
T*
(   1. Physical Process of Soil Compaction:) Tj
T*
(   - Anthropogenic Drivers: Heavy agricultural machinery wheel traffic, livestock overgrazing, and) Tj
T*
(   construction vehicles exert mechanical axle loads that exceed the internal shear strength of) Tj
T*
(   the soil.) Tj
T*
(   - Disruption of Pore Size Distribution: Compaction specifically crushes large macropores \(> 75) Tj
T*
(   microns diameter, responsible for rapid gravitational water infiltration and aeration\),) Tj
T*
(   converting them into micropores.) Tj
T*
(   - Density and Resistance Elevation: Dry bulk density increases significantly \(often exceeding) Tj
T*
(   root-limiting thresholds of 1.6 to 1.8 g/cm3\), while mechanical soil penetration resistance) Tj
T*
(   rises above 2.0 MPa, causing mechanical impedance to root elongation.) Tj
T*
(   2. Hydrological and Biological Consequences:) Tj
T*
(   - Saturated hydraulic conductivity \(Ksat\) plummets by 90-99%, leading to accelerated surface) Tj
T*
(   runoff, loss of groundwater recharge, and soil waterlogging under wet conditions.) Tj
T*
(   - Microbial asphyxiation: Subsurface hypoxia halts aerobic microbial respiration, triggering) Tj
T*
(   denitrification and greenhouse gas emissions \(N2O\).) Tj
T*
(   3. Urban Soil Sealing:) Tj
T*
(   - Complete coverage of natural soil surfaces by impermeable anthropogenic materials \(asphalt,) Tj
T*
(   concrete, roofing\).) Tj
T*
(   - Disrupts the hydrological cycle by preventing any groundwater infiltration, driving urban) Tj
T*
(   flash floods, increasing urban heat island intensity, and destroying subsurface carbon) Tj
T*
(   sequestration.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
