(   2. Biostimulation Engineering Protocol:) Tj
T*
(   - Principle: Native soil microbial consortia possess latent catabolic pathways for hydrocarbon) Tj
T*
(   degradation, but activity is constrained by nutrient and oxygen deficits.) Tj
T*
(   - Agricultural Interventions:) Tj
T*
(   * Nutrient Balancing: Hydrocarbons provide vast carbon excess, driving the soil C:N:P ratio to) Tj
