(   Rule of Evaluation: If any single sub-indicator shows significant degradation, the entire land) Tj
T*
(   parcel is categorized as degraded \('One Out, All Out' rule\).) Tj
T*
(   3. The Mitigation Hierarchy:) Tj
T*
(   - Avoid: Proactive land-use spatial planning to steer economic development and infrastructure) Tj
T*
(   away from vulnerable, high-biocapacity soils.) Tj
T*
(   - Reduce: Adopting sustainable agronomic practices \(conservation tillage, precision irrigation,) Tj
T*
(   bio-fertilizers\) on working lands to minimize degradation.) Tj
T*
(   - Reverse: Actively rehabilitating and restoring previously degraded soils through) Tj
T*
(   re-afforestation, wetland re-flooding, and biochar-assisted soil conditioning.) Tj
T*
